$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=step3w  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma 4.2 (Step 3 halts) at windowed scales: for n large, any scales in the window and any admissible Q of size T , some shift k coprime to L yields a pool of at least c ( log n ) ^ 1.2 primes (Lean: step3_haltsW of Step3W.lean).

